WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.420
Someone once said...

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:57.090
There is fatty tuna meat that's a gamble

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.860
and can be used like a game of trump,

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:06.200
because the taste is 
either superb or awful...

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.340
Fatty Trump Meat!

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:15.410
On a certain kind of peacock, 
if the number of symbols

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:21.820
on its feathers is 21, they'll 
taste like sweet, dark chocolate...

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:28.620
Blackjacock!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.660
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:38.630
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:45.510
In order to get Meteor Garlic, a training 
ingredient from Ichiryu's list,

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:50.340
Toriko, Coco, and Komatsu head for the 
Gourmet Casino in the kingdom of Jiddal.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.810
Poison Puffer Whale! They really do sell it!

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.280
Jiddal is a kingdom overflowing 
with illegal ingredients,

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.590
but Match and his men from 
the Gourmet Mafia show up

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:02.150
with the intention of stamping 
out those ingredients.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:07.260
Match tells Toriko and friends who's 
really running the Gourmet Casino.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:11.100
The boss of the Underground 
Cooking World, Livebearer.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:15.130
He's a dark chef who also works 
as a dealer at the casino.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:19.200
Then Toriko and his comrades 
entered the Gourmet Casino...

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:27.910
Enter: The Boss of the Underground 
Cooking World, Livebearer!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:36.020
Is all of this casino space?!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.720
Wow!

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.630
Toriko-san, Coco-san, Match-san,

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:43.290
let's check it out!

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.900
Ooh, Gourmet Roulette!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.330
If you win, you get ingredients!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.540
Who's odd? Odd? Even? Who's for even?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.900
A dice game!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.900
Come on!

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.840
All of the ingredients here are top notch!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.610
17! 17!

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.240
Snackjack?

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.250
Eight Grapes!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.350
Not even close!

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.080
This place is gigantic!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.720
And there are so many games!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.190
Anyone can enjoy the general floor.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.420
It's a wholesome, legitimate casino.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.560
On the surface, anyway...

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.870
Is something wrong?

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:24.830
Yes.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.640
One of the Four Kings, Coco, is here again.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.770
And this time he's with Toriko!

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.210
Coco and Toriko?!

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.280
Let's see, what are today's prizes?

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.850
Odds Board
Caramelted Corn
Sapphire Melon
Whale Pig
Fried Rock
Dun-dun Dun Ramen

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:38.010
They've got quite the selection here!

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.980
Far from illegal, all of these are 
expensive, delicious-looking ingredients!

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:46.020
If there aren't any narcotic ingredients, 
there's no sense gamblin' here.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.120
What should we do, Match-san?

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.930
My guess is they deal in the narcotic 
ingredients in the VIP area.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.530
We've gotta find it and slip in there.

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:58.630
Coin Exchange

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.000
Hey, you guys...

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.860
First, we need to raise some lucky capital.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.630
You intend to challenge the casino?

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.070
Yeah, well...

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.800
Those ingredients look too good to pass up.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.340
There it is!

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.510
The limitless amount black card!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.580
100 million yen worth from 
my Gourmet credit card...

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:13.110
A ton is coming out...

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.220
10,000 chips, each one worth 10,000 yen.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.550
Isn't that more than you need?

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.850
The more lucky capital, the better.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.320
Look at this luster!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.760
This gloss! This shine!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.720
It's not a Gourmet coin for nothin'!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:24.830
Gourmet coin?

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.060
Actually, this coin is a tasty treat!

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:28.960
Thanks for the food!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.300
Delicious!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.330
Let me try one, too!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.500
Here.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:40.740
Yummy... It's as sweet 
as the finest chocolate!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.180
And the texture is tops, too!

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.180
These coins are worth every yen!

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.580
Really?

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.120
Don't eat up our precious lucky capital.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.050
All I need is a single one million yen coin.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.820
A one million yen coin?! Let me take a bite!

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:57.720
Forget about it.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.160
Please, just a little nibble!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.030
I said no!

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:02.760
Then just a lick...?

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:03.430
No way!

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:04.860
Can I at least smell it?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:05.670
No!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:06.530
It's Toriko!

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.270
That's Toriko, one of the Four Kings!

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:09.370
All righty...

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.540
Here I go!

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.710
Go!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.810
He needs just one more six!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.750
Six!

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.220
Yeah!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:24.680
I finally got three in a row!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.920
You get a Slots Fruit, too!

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.920
And on top of that, since you got 
three sixes, your bet is sextupled.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.120
You bet one million, so you get six million!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.790
Well, not too shabby.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.760
If only you hadn't lost so much up to now...

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.330
20 fails in a row!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.260
Oh, shut up!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.700
Sorry...

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:41.570
Don't bring it up, Komatsu.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.330
Boss, I looked around,

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.300
Sorry, I won't.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.340
Not another word...

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.540
but I couldn't find the VIP area.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.370
I see...

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.740
Toriko, Komatsu-kun, how are you making out?

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:53.110
Wow, Coco-san! Is that filled with coins?!

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.780
You really have earned a bundle!

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:56.580
What can I say?

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:00.750
But are you sure this okay? It kinds 
of feels like we're just having fun...

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.450
This is just fine.

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:08.730
I get it...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:13.460
Listen, guys, I want you 
to break the bank, too.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.800
Y-Yes, sir...

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.300
Here, Komatsu, you have some fun, too!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.700
I-I will!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.180
Now that's manly spirit! He 
put it all on one number!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.920
That's Match-san for you!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:56.840
Get in there!!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.410
D-Determined spirit from a relaxed state!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.210
His determination pushed it in!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.180
That's our boss!

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:19.730
Alright, one more time!

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.260
18-fold...

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.230
...Spiked Punch!

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.980
Well, after spinnin' 18 times, I figured 
I'd rack up at least a few wins...

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:38.810
Huh?

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:41.180
Sir, I'm afraid you can't do that...

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:42.850
I can't?

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.750
Then here we go!

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.250
Odd? Or even?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.930
What's it gonna be? Do I hear odd? Or even?

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.130
It's about spirit... Gotta fire myself up...

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.830
Odd? Or even?!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:58.970
Odd?!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.930
Ten people for even,

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.340
five people for odd!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.340
Alright!

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.470
I'll go with odd!

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:06.140
You winnin', Komatsu?!

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.270
W-Wait a second!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.840
Toriko-san, what are you doing?!

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.180
The gentleman who just played even wins!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.480
Let's see!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.080
Here!

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:18.820
Three and one, making it even!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.920
An even number!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.490
I did it!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:28.060
I won thanks to you, Toriko-san!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.160
I'm so happy! This is my first time!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.060
You only got three coins?!

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:35.630
That reaction's out of line with 
the number of coins you won!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.800
I'd expect you to be that kind 
of happy winning <i>100</i> coins!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:42.110
What are you talking about?! A win's a win!

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.510
Whatever. Follow me.

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:46.340
We're gonna play a game that's got 
a much bigger payoff! Come on!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.180
W-W-What is that...?!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:53.420
A gigantic slot machine!

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.390
It's this Gourmet Casino's main 
attraction, the 100-sided Slot.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.820
100-sided?!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:00.860
Yeah. 100 sides vertically and horizontally.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.260
There are 60 kinds of pictures.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:06.900
It rotates at a speed of 
100-150 meters per second.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:10.740
It's hard enough getting three in a 
row with slots, but 100 in a row?!

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.240
That's impossible!

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:14.210
Y'know, he's right...

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.670
Well, shall I give it a shot?

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.110
That guy's going for it!

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:22.750
Coco-san, don't tell me you got all 
those coins from this slot machine?!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.420
No, I just checked this out.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:27.620
That's Coco-sama, one of the Four Kings!

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:29.390
Coco-sama!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.460
You operate it from this table.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.460
First, you insert a coin...

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.630
The highest amount you can use 
is a coin worth a million yen.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.760
You're going to bet a million yen?!

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.400
Well, switch on...

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.070
It's so fast!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.970
I can't see any of the pictures!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:53.640
You can see the slot pictures 
on the monitor right here,

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.610
but it's easier for me 
to look at them directly.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.470
Exactly right!

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:27.580
W-What is this?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.010
It's mind-blowing!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.520
The drum speeds up the further right you go,

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.420
and the symbols with higher 
multipliers decrease,

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.960
but even at a speed like this,

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.430
to Coco's eyes, it's pretty 
much standing still.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.130
There's only one left!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.500
Coco-san!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:15.920
You did it! Coco-san, you got 'em all!

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:19.090
I've been coming here for years, 
but this is the first time

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.930
I've seen all the symbols lined up!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.140
Replay what just happened.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:31.970
Yes, sir.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.680
We can't object to the 
way he pushed the button.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.280
Coco, one of the Four Kings...

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:44.620
He's been to this casino before, 
but he didn't play any games then.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:48.050
We can't disregard his 
career as a fortune teller.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:52.360
At this rate, he'll walk away 
with a ton of our ingredients.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.730
Should we let them in <i>there</i>?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.500
Boss...

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:07.440
It seems we've got a couple 
of first-rate guests.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.020
Toriko and Coco, two of the Four Kings...

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:29.090
I would love to have them 
as part of my collection.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:44.440
A mountain of delicious-looking ingredients!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.040
How many are there?!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.450
They all look so delicious!

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.310
So that's what you get 
with a million yen coin!

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:52.250
A trillion yen worth of prizes!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:54.020
That's a humongous haul!

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.820
Congratulations.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.290
A humongous haul!

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:59.420
It seems Lady Luck has smiled 
upon you this evening.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.320
Thank you.

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:02.260
But it was ability, not luck.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.290
As always, his words have 
a poisonous sting...

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.430
In that case, perhaps you'd 
like to test your ability...

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:12.000
...with games that are even more fun.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.300
Fun games, huh?

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:18.440
This way, please, if you would.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.910
You hooked 'em.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.880
This <i>is</i> what you were after, right?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:31.750
If you'd won any more in the general 
area, it'd be bad for business.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:35.420
And so the Gourmet Casino staff

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:37.930
are leading us to a part of the casino 
where the odds are even worse,

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.100
so they can wring the coins out of us.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.360
That's the VIP area.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.500
And you're half-right.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.540
What's the other half?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.870
Relax.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:56.040
We'll take responsibility for the 
ingredients you won and carry them for you.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.360
Please, proceed.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.330
This will take you to the exclusive VIP area.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.100
Normally, only VIP members 
or guests who have gambled

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:22.940
a certain amount over the course 
of a year are granted access,

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.670
so this time is special.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:29.010
But it's not like you're lettin' us 
in just because we cleaned up, right?

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.310
True.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:34.650
It's also because you fulfill one more 
condition for access to this area.

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:36.820
The ingredients we're carrying, yeah?

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:37.680
Correct.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.050
The ingredients we're carrying?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:43.220
There are some games where 
you gamble with food.

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:44.390
Huh...

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:52.030
In the general area, you gambled 
with coins in exchange for money,

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:58.470
but in the VIP area, our guests enjoy 
betting with ingredients that they have.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:01.540
So that's what you meant by "half-right".

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.780
You didn't win before just 
to draw their attention.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:08.450
You purposely won ingredients in 
there to gamble with in the VIP area.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.210
I can't deny it.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:14.820
In the VIP area, our guests 
only win or lose ingredients.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.860
Games you gamble with 
ingredients, not money...

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.390
Fitting for the Gourmet Casino's VIP room...

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:23.760
Well, there is a place 
beyond the VIP area, too...

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.500
Beyond the VIP area?

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:28.300
This way...

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.850
Shouldn't have gone for that long shot...

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.020
Poisoned by a Poisonapple...

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:52.320
Some illegal ingredients 
are highly poisonous...

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:11.210
This is Giant Watermelon Splitting!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:13.610
Who's gonna split 'em?! There they go!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.150
So this is the Gourmet Casino's VIP area...

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.860
Oh, dear. Who would've thought 
that apple had poison in it?

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.060
Too bad.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:34.160
Well, I'll collect the ingredient 
you bet... one Sunshine Egg.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.830
Alright. I'll play the game once more.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.400
And this time I'll win!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:41.900
Do you think that robber will get away clean?

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.670
Or will he be shot dead?

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.580
There's no way he'll escape...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.210
Then let's bet on it!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:52.250
They were VIP guests?!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.080
I-In the VIP area...

00:17:56.890 --> 00:18:01.090
In the VIP area, do people 
bet on other people's lives?

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:05.160
Don't worry. All of the participants

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:09.230
are people who haven't paid their 
sizable debt to the casino.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.910
In exchange for erasing their debt,

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.740
they willingly volunteer for these games.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:26.780
I thought these were games where 
people just bet ingredients...

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:31.950
In the natural world, even humans make 
for fine ingredients, don't they?

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.650
Ingredients...?

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.990
Match-san, over there...

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.320
Poison Eye
Okra Jello
Infectious Jellyfish
Trance Snake
Jet Hooligan

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.890
Yeah. Illegal narcotic 
ingredients one and all...

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.800
I'm gonna confiscate every 
last one and trash 'em!

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:50.300
But to do that, I need Coco's help.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.510
That's a Gamble Berry.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:55.740
Gamble Berry?!

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.980
The taste is exquisite,

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.680
but every one in ten

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:02.820
is so poisonous that whoever eats 
it dies within five minutes.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.990
Would you like to get in 
on this wager, gentlemen?

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:11.990
Or perhaps you would like to 
take the challenge yourself?

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.690
You can make a lot more than 
betting on other people.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:19.130
By participating in a game 
with your life as the stake,

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.500
you'll get an immense thrill

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.300
and truly experience what it is to gamble.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.040
I'll pass.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:26.510
It'd be no gamble.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.810
You see, that poison wouldn't work on me.

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:30.280
It wouldn't work?!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.840
Then why don't I do it?

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:34.050
Match-san, that's...

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.280
It'll be fine.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:38.450
You've seen Coco's gambling strength.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:39.480
We can have faith in him.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:44.360
We bagged plenty of ingredients 
ourselves in the general area.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.860
We're entrusting you with 
the ingredients we won.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:49.890
So bet...

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:52.060
Bet on me!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.530
In that case...

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:02.770
...why not bet on even better things?

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.910
I invite you

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.580
beyond the VIP area.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.350
Owner!

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.390
He's strong...

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.060
The boss of the Underground Cooking World,

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.890
Livebearer...

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:26.100
He's...

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.730
Indeed. It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:33.300
Let's all bet on something more delicious!

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:42.210
In those younger days,

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:44.150
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:48.720
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:52.020
After that, time passed

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.520
Were you able to grasp

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:59.130
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.830
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:08.100
You turn into a coward,

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:13.580
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.450
So now's the time!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:26.090
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:30.360
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:33.430
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:37.260
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:41.070
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:45.010
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:49.240
We're going to use a camera this 
week too, so get yours ready!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.650
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:57.080
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:57.850 --> 00:22:00.950
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.160
Alright, here we go!

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.860
A heaping helping...

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:08.860
Open!

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:12.570
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:18.670
A - Golomclops Capture Level 42

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:15.700
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:18.670
Everything may just work 
out the way you want!

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:25.980
B - Elephantsaurus Capture Level 17

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:22.680
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:24.180
That thing you've been 
looking for all this time

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:25.980
may show up in an unexpected place!

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:34.220
C - Underbite Dragon Capture Level 4

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:29.680
And I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:31.880
You may not be able to concentrate 
because you're so tired.

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:34.220
Take a heaping helping of caution 
so you don't forget anything.

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:37.720
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:39.060
Are you ready?

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:44.960
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:41.790
If you take a photo of that scene

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:45.060
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:46.830
Alright, here we go!

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:49.900
Three! Two! One!

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:51.140
Scoop chance!

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:52.940
Three people!

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:54.370
If they come together,

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:56.610
three heads are better than one.

00:22:57.310 --> 00:23:01.150
In other words, if three people work 
together, they'll get some good wisdom!

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:05.080
Will Rum, Shin, and Rui be 
in the spotlight next week?!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.020
Gambling your memories of food?

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:13.490
The wager from hell begins with with his Gourmet life on the line!

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:16.860
Life and Death Card Game! Gourmet Tasting!

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:18.790
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
